    "role": "system",
    "content": "你是正文作者。根据 manuscript_guide 的全文写法、chapter_assignment 的当前安排、materials 的来源内容，以及 accepted_body_markdown 中真实已写前文，继续完成同一篇文章。\n\n把本章要讲清的关系组织成连贯论述。由你决定章内解释顺序、段落组合、详略和小标题；写作安排不是逐项作答的模板。几项内容可以在同一比较或一组段落中一起讲清。材料中有帮助的机制、实验细节、条件和反例可以充分展开，重复的研究介绍则只保留当前讨论所需的部分。后章从前章已经建立的认识继续推进，不每次重启一篇小综述。\n\n以现象、机制、具体对象及其关系作句子主语，让相邻句接住同一个问题；来源编号只用于引用，不用内部 P 编号代替讨论对象。依据真实前文判断哪些解释已经完成；重返同一研究时只展开当前关系所需的新条件或比较。过渡直接承接问题与关系，避免反复用“上一章/本章/下一章将”介绍章节。标题服务于内容，不规定统一句式；段落讲清楚之后可以结束，无需每段补上重要性评价、局限声明或未来展望。不要把指南、工作安排、内部编号或给作者的指令写进正文。\n\n来源材料提供事实，指南提供写法。沿用给定引用身份；引用统一写成半角方括号 [P####]（例如 [P0001]），使用 materials 中确实存在的精确句柄，不写裸号、圆括号或自行编号；多个来源分别写成 [P0001][P0002]。保留数字和影响含义的条件，不编造来源，不把已有正文当作独立证据。处理相近或不一致表述时，用清楚的对象、范围和比较表达，不为行文顺畅虚构一致性。只在确实缺少必要材料时申请回读。\n\n本次交付 chapter_assignment 指定范围的新正文及其要求的表格或图示内容，不重发既有前文。没有固定段数、小节数、字数或引用数指标。不要输出思考过程或自评分。\n\n优先输出自然 Markdown 正文，最后附伴随记录：\n\n```guide_writer_metadata\n{\"complete\":true,\"remaining_content\":[]}\n```\n\n若确有尚未讲完的内容，complete 为 false，remaining_content 用简短自然语言说明具体缺口，不使用细纲任务 ID。例如“尚需比较两种方法在小样本情形下的差异”。不要为了填写字段虚构缺口，也不要用空泛的“需要更深入”代替缺口。\n\n也接受 JSON：{\"body_markdown\":\"本次正文\",\"complete\":true,\"remaining_content\":[]}。\n\n若需要尚未提供的材料，单独输出 {\"read_source_handles\":[\"来源句柄\"],\"read_atom_ids\":[]} 或用 read_atom_ids 指定已知原子，不能同时交付正文。现有材料已足够时直接成文。\n"
  },
  {
    "role": "user",
    "content": "{\n  \"manuscript_guide\": \"全文按\\\"临床关联证据—免疫机制—代谢物中介—外部干扰—主动干预—毒性管理—方法学与转化边界\\\"推进。引言与正文最终应实际引用至少150篇去重文献；引用必须参与论证，不为凑数机械平分到各章，也不把尚未写出的引言预先计入已完成指标。来源别名应统一处理：P0333与P0584、P0402与P0576、P0049与P0605等视为同一来源，避免重复计数；工具或检索导航标识不得充当正文文献编号。全篇反复出现的核心对象必须有明确主讲位置：Ch1负责观察性关联强度、队列异质性、方案修饰和证据阶梯入口；Ch2负责免疫机制链条并严格区分动物因果与人类关联；Ch3负责代谢物分子靶点、情境依赖和TME浓度缺口；Ch4负责抗生素、PPI、饮食和生活方式等外部暴露的时机、剂量、癌种背景与因果边界；Ch5负责FMT、定义菌群和活体生物药的临床转化、疗效异质性与证据等级；Ch6负责毒性预测、疗效/毒性耦合或解耦、供体与方案情境化安全管理；Ch7负责把前述瓶颈转为方法学设计原则。跨章承接要具体：Ch1让读者理解关联存在但不可普适，留下机制解释和干预验证问题；Ch2解释微生物如何进入先天和适应性免疫，但不解决代谢物浓度与外部扰动问题；Ch3把机制落到化学介质和受体通路，留下血浆与TME暴露脱节的问题；Ch4说明临床现实中的暴露如何重塑这些轴，留下主动干预是否可行；Ch5评估主动干预的疗效与边界，留下毒性管理问题；Ch6处理疗效与毒性如何耦合或解耦，留下预测和标准化难题；Ch7归纳为可执行研究设计。写作中不得使用同一种\\\"背景→机制→应用→局限\\\"模板套所有对象，也不得在每章结尾重复同一句证据不足。比较必须先明确维度：癌种、ICI方案、暴露时窗、基线/纵向、供体特征、宿主免疫状态、模型系统与人体证据、血浆/粪便与TME浓度。对可能性、条件性和阴性结果要保留原有限定：观察性关联不写成因果，动物模型不直接外推人类，血浆浓度不等同组织浓度，Phase II信号不写成Phase III确证，特定癌种或方案的结果不扩大为普适结论。关于P0593：该来源实际内容为别嘌醇通过嘌呤补救途径增加肌苷分泌、增强肿瘤免疫原性的机制研究（小鼠CT26模型+人类膀胱癌回顾性队列），并非TACITO试验。正文中不得将P0593作为TACITO d-FMT联合ICI治疗mRCC的来源引用。P0593应在Ch3肌苷部分作为非微生物来源肌苷增效的平行机制证据使用，或在Ch5作为非菌群代谢干预的对比案例。mRCC中FMT联合ICI的随机证据应引用P0090系统综述中汇总的Phase II RCT数据（FMT联合pembrolizumab+axitinib，1年PFS 66.7% vs 35.0%）。\\n\\n全文章节写作安排：\\n\\nCh1 — 实体瘤中肠道微生物组与 ICI 疗效的临床关联证据\\n本章先建立\\\"有信号但无通用标志物\\\"的判断，再解释为何不能外推。顺序为：跨癌种阳性信号与反例 → 队列异质性与功能趋同 → 治疗方案修饰 → 外部药物暴露作为修饰变量 → 基线快照局限与纵向动态 → 证据阶梯表。跨队列统计、肠型、SCRUM-Japan、mCRPC反例和菌株级方案依赖共同支撑无普适标志物；JCOG2007在此主讲方案特异性，后章只回指。抗生素和PPI只保留总体效应量、关键时间窗和校正必要，详细剂量反应、HCC阴性、PPI机制留给Ch4。FMT-LUMINate、MIMic、MITRIC在表中只保留阶段、人群、主要结局和关键限制，机制与试验比较留给Ch5。本章结尾应留下两个问题：这些关联通过什么免疫机制表达，以及主动干预能否跨越观察性关联。\\n\\nCh2 — 微生物调节 ICI 疗效的免疫学机制\\n本章以机制链条组织，不按菌种罗列。顺序为：先天识别与DC启动 → 适应性启动与T细胞亚群 → 屏障、易位与髓系重编程 → 肿瘤类型和模型差异。每个节点都要区分证据层级：小鼠或体外因果、人类宏基因组或伴随观察、肿瘤内微生物边界。六酰化LPS、CD103+ DC、PD-L2/RGMb主讲先天和DC启动；分子模拟主讲适应性启动；P0098的Treg动态只作短回指，主要免疫中介留给Ch6。屏障部分要说明屏障损伤与疗效增强可以分离，细菌易位要区分主动免疫转运与被动漏肠，髓系部分要说明同一易位信号可产生促炎或抑制后果。最后用表格比较肿瘤类型机制与证据类型，不重复Ch1的临床关联强度。\\n\\nCh3 — 微生物代谢物的中介作用与分子机制\\n本章按分子靶点和情境条件组织代谢物，不按来源菌列表。先写SCFAs的双向性：PD-1背景下增强CD8+ T细胞和记忆，CTLA-4背景下可能促Treg或抑制DC共刺激；再写缺氧、葡萄糖剥夺和浓度阈值造成的效应反转。肌苷部分必须分开两条机制：肿瘤内在UBA6抑制与T细胞A2AR或碳源作用；临床只保留血浆关联和早期随机信号，并明确人体TME实测浓度缺失。胆汁酸与色氨酸代谢物围绕TGR5/FXR、AhR/RORγt等受体网络写局部与系统差异。功能通路部分由Ch2回指，但主讲放在本章，用于说明功能特征优于分类学。最后的TME浓度缺口要具体说明其阻碍剂量优化、因果推断和临床给药设计。P0593（别嘌醇/肌苷研究）在本章作为非微生物来源肌苷增效的平行证据使用：别嘌醇通过抑制XDH增加肌苷分泌→上调MHC-I和PD-L1→增强CD8+ T细胞杀伤，在CT26模型中联合抗PD-1实现4/6完全清除，人类膀胱癌回顾性队列（n=50）中抗痛风药使用者OS显著优于未使用者。此案例说明肌苷通路可被非菌群手段激活，但不能替代菌群来源肌苷的生理浓度讨论；其人类证据仅为小样本回顾性关联，不升级为因果。\\n\\nCh4 — 外部因素对微生物 - 免疫轴的干扰\\n本章主讲外部暴露如何改变微生物-免疫轴，并与Ch1的修饰变量概览分工：Ch1只给出效应量和时间窗入口，本章展开时机、剂量、药物类别、肿瘤背景和因果边界。抗生素按时间窗和疗程组织，加入HCC阴性结果与PD-L1分层，防止单一负面模型。PPI部分从流行病学关联转到口腔化易位、多样性下降和近期化疗修饰，并用H2B对照提出降级建议。饮食和生活方式部分区分食物基质、定义菌株补充剂和非标准化益生菌，避免把益生菌统一写成有益或有害。所有推断都要标注观察性证据和适应症偏倚，不能把药物暴露与疗效下降直接写成菌群因果链。\\n\\nCh5 — 微生物干预策略的临床转化现状\\n本章是主动干预的临床转化主轴。顺序为：初治人群信号 → 耐药人群边界 → 定义菌群和活体生物药 → 安全性边界 → 证据等级与标准化。FMT-LUMINate的疗效与\\\"有害菌丢失而非供体定植\\\"机制在此主讲；MIMic的定植动力学和生存数据也在此展开；MITRIC主讲阴性原因。Ch1的证据阶梯表只作为入口，本章不重复列表式介绍，而解释异质性来源。关于mRCC中FMT联合ICI的随机证据：细纲原将TACITO数据归于P0593，但P0593实际内容为别嘌醇/肌苷机制研究，不包含TACITO试验数据。本章mRCC FMT随机证据应引用P0090系统综述中汇总的Phase II RCT数据：FMT联合pembrolizumab+axitinib，1年PFS 66.7% vs 35.0%（p=0.036），ORR 54% vs 28%，未增加≥3级不良事件。此数据来自会议摘要级别的II期RCT，应标注证据等级为早期随机、小样本。不得在正文中引用不存在的TACITO具体数值（如12个月PFS 70% vs 41%、中位PFS 24.0 vs 9.0个月、P=0.053），除非后续获得独立来源确认。安全性部分与Ch6分工：本章保留干预安全边界和试验设计含义，毒性预测、耦合或解耦和管理策略留给Ch6。\\n\\nCh6 — 微生物组与免疫治疗毒性的关联\\n本章从毒性表型出发，不按药物列表。顺序为：结肠炎最强证据与因果验证 → 器官特异性和预测模型困境 → 疗效与毒性耦合或解耦 → 干预相关毒性的情境依赖 → 分子机制。Ch5已讲干预疗效与总体安全边界，本章新增的是毒性预测标志物、供体-方案交互和管理含义。FMT-LUMINate的Cluster B、Prevotella和Segatella copri数据在此主讲毒性情境，不再重述完整试验设计；P0284的屏障和代谢双重机制只保留与毒性相关的部分，详细机制回指Ch2。非结肠炎毒性必须明确样本量不足，不能把结肠炎结论外推到心肌炎或神经毒性。\\n\\nCh7 — 方法学挑战与未来研究方向\\n本章不是再次总结各章局限，而是把瓶颈转为可操作设计原则。顺序为：技术与标准化 → 观察性因果推断 → 临床证据与人群表征 → 未来方法。技术部分用标准化重分析和培养组学说明噪音与真实信号并存；因果部分强调反向因果、药物、饮食、年龄等混杂和孟德尔随机化边界；临床部分强调Phase III缺席、年龄、儿科、种族和TME浓度缺口；未来部分提出功能导向、多组学、AI、类器官或芯片和供体制剂标准化。引用应服务设计原则，不重复前文具体数值，也不把每个已知缺口写成全文唯一主线。\",\n  \"chapter_assignment\": {\n    \"chapter_id\": \"Ch6\",\n    \"title\": \"微生物组与免疫治疗毒性的关联\",\n    \"writing_arrangement\": \"本章从毒性表型出发，不按药物列表。顺序为：结肠炎最强证据与因果验证 → 器官特异性和预测模型困境 → 疗效与毒性耦合或解耦 → 干预相关毒性的情境依赖 → 分子机制。Ch5已讲干预疗效与总体安全边界，本章新增的是毒性预测标志物、供体-方案交互和管理含义。FMT-LUMINate的Cluster B、Prevotella和Segatella copri数据在此主讲毒性情境，不再重述完整试验设计；P0284的屏障和代谢双重机制只保留与毒性相关的部分，详细机制回指Ch2。非结肠炎毒性必须明确样本量不足，不能把结肠炎结论外推到心肌炎或神经毒性。\",\n    \"required_content\": [\n      \"保留结肠炎微生物指纹和动物FMT因果证据，包括产丁酸菌下降、肠球菌富集或类似表型。\",\n      \"保留非结肠炎irAEs样本量不足、多重检验校正后不稳定和模型泛化受限。\",\n      \"保留疗效与毒性耦合的例子，如Akkermansia muciniphila与疗效和irAE风险并存。\",\n      \"保留疗效与毒性解耦的例子，如Eubacterium siraeum或SCFA产生菌与有效且低毒性状态的关联。\",\n      \"保留供体聚类与ICI方案交互表，明确Prevotella富集Cluster B与双ICI背景下严重毒性的关联。\",\n      \"保留屏障受损、代谢物失衡、分子模拟、MyD88和TNF/TNFR2等机制，同时标注多数机制来自模型或体外证据。\"\n    ]\n  },\n  \"materials\": {\n    \"schema_version\": \"optomind.guided_body_materials.v1\",\n    \"evidence_atoms\": [\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dc0a2ccc128ec1b70b351ed9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"abstract\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7b4744c7ad19ef68380c907c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0650dc0b918fba639db74764\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用“临床观察+动物因果验证”的两阶段设计。第一阶段为横断面观察：收集32例irAE患者粪便，通过16S rDNA测序分析菌群组成（PCoA, LEfSe）及功能预测，对比结肠炎型（n=8）与非结肠炎型（n=24）患者的差异。第二阶段为体内因果实验：建立抗生素清除小鼠肠道菌群模型，分别移植结肠炎型和非结肠炎型患者的粪便菌群，随后给予双免疫检查点阻断（抗PD-1 + 抗CTLA-4）治疗，监测小鼠体重、疾病活动指数（DAI）、组织学评分及免疫细胞浸润情况，以评估供体菌群对受体结肠炎发生的影响。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::66d76f5eb5b3514b53450f1c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了ICIs相关结肠炎患者与健康对照（非结肠炎irAE）之间肠道菌群特征的详细图谱，识别出特定的风险菌群标志物（如低拟杆菌/双歧杆菌，高肠球菌）和功能改变（产丁酸菌减少）。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代人类队列的基线特征匹配情况、测序深度细节及多重检验校正方法；小鼠实验仅报告了部分死亡个体的极端数据，未提供所有个体的完整分布统计，且样本量较小（每组9只），可能限制结果的稳健性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1f06e9ea92ea153bace4387c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"通过FMT实验在动物模型中建立了肠道菌群与ICIs诱导结肠炎之间的因果联系，表明特定的人类菌群具有致结肠炎潜力。\",\n          \"limits\": \"动物模型无法完全模拟人类复杂的免疫系统和肿瘤微环境；FMT实验仅使用了单一时间点的供体菌群，未考虑菌群动态变化；摘要未说明是否排除了其他宿主因素（如基因背景、饮食）对结果的干扰。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::768a0afe5a7442dbc6d309fa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"人类队列比较：8例结肠炎型irAE vs 24例非结肠炎型irAE患者\",\n          \"finding\": \"菌群组成存在显著差异（Adonis P=0.003）。结肠炎型患者中拟杆菌门（Bacteroidota）和双歧杆菌属（Bifidobacterium）丰度较低，而变形菌门（Proteobacteria）和肠球菌属（Enterococcus）丰度较高。主要产丁酸菌总丰度在结肠炎型患者中显著降低（P=0.018）。功能预测显示环境信息处理、遗传信息处理及代谢通路存在差异。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bff31da88cca7e46ed16f5f7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"小鼠FMT实验：抗生素预处理小鼠接受结肠炎型（Colitic-irAE-FMT）或非结肠炎型（Non-irAE-FMT）患者菌群移植，随后联合抗PD-1/抗CTLA-4治疗\",\n          \"finding\": \"9只Colitic-irAE-FMT小鼠中有3只发展为致命性严重结肠炎，而9只Non-irAE-FMT小鼠全部存活且无结肠炎（P=0.052）。死亡小鼠表现出更快的体重下降和更高的DAI评分。组织学评分显示，死亡小鼠（14分）显著高于非结肠炎组（3.89 ± 1.17）和存活结肠炎组（3.67 ± 1.03）。免疫组化显示死亡小鼠CD8+、CD4+和CD20+细胞浸润较高，支持免疫介导的结肠炎发生。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fd96b7055d5fee07ab697ea2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0cb9249a1bedc5d665819a64\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管已知肠道微生物群影响ICIs的疗效，但其如何影响免疫相关不良事件（irAEs），特别是ICIs相关结肠炎的发生机制尚不清楚。本研究试图明确肠道微生物组与ICIs相关结肠炎之间的关联性及因果联系。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::794e1f1d3aff4d81c94882d9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究对象为接受抗PD-1治疗的晚期恶性肿瘤患者及其衍生模型。研究聚焦于免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）引发的免疫相关不良事件（irAEs），具体限定在结肠炎型irAE（colitic irAE）与非结肠炎型irAE之间的差异，以及肠道微生物组在其中的作用。样本包括32例人类粪便样本和通过粪菌移植（FMT）构建的小鼠模型。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::23279ff6e33de3360f4f34ab\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在探索肠道微生物组与ICIs相关结肠炎之间的关联及因果关系。研究首先收集了32名在接受抗PD-1治疗后出现irAE的晚期肿瘤患者的粪便样本，利用Illumina MiSeq平台进行16S rDNA扩增子测序。通过比较8名结肠炎型irAE患者与24名非结肠炎型irAE患者的菌群特征，发现两者在门、属水平及功能通路上的显著差异。随后，研究将来自结肠炎型和非结肠炎型患者的粪便样本分别移植给抗生素处理过的小鼠，并联合使用抗PD-1和抗CTLA-4抗体进行治疗。结果显示，接受结肠炎型患者菌群移植的小鼠出现了严重的致死性结肠炎，而非结肠炎型患者菌群移植的小鼠均存活且无结肠炎症状，从而在动物模型中验证了特定肠道菌群对ICIs相关结肠炎的致病潜力。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fd8e86eda99541c73ae9e6c6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅针对结肠炎这一特定irAE类型，不直接回答菌群对肿瘤缩小（efficacy）的直接调节机制，需结合其他研究综合判断。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道菌群失调与ICIs疗效/安全性关联的具体表型证据。指出结肠炎型患者特有的菌群特征（低拟杆菌/双歧杆菌，高肠球菌），可作为评估ICIs治疗风险的生物标志物参考。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::06c366e630e21e39d4a70148\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"机制推断基于功能预测和表型观察，未直接验证具体分子通路（如丁酸受体信号或特定炎症因子轴），属于假设性机制，需与其他机制研究相互印证。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了菌群介导ICIs相关结肠炎的因果机制线索。通过FMT实验证明特定菌群可直接导致结肠炎，并提示产丁酸菌减少和代谢通路改变可能是潜在机制。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7a6cd00af868b9c5e36a2921\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"明确了肠道微生物组不仅是ICIs疗效的影响因素，也是irAEs（特别是结肠炎）的关键驱动因素，拓展了对ICIs副作用机制的理解。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7a5d958d2312aac42bf92dae\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"展示了从人类观察到动物因果验证的研究范式，以及特定菌群（如肠球菌）在病理状态下的正向作用与保护性菌群（如拟杆菌）负向作用的对比。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f6cf5ac2e26a12b4f9c3e387\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究聚焦于结肠炎型irAE，其发现的菌群特征可能不适用于其他类型的irAEs（如肺炎、肝炎等）。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c2e07bb62ea1771f63f9503b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"小鼠FMT实验中的致死性结肠炎是极端表型，不代表所有接受结肠炎型菌群移植的患者都会发病，需谨慎外推至临床风险预测。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c3bf71e8312f13b2c658b804\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"功能预测基于16S rDNA数据，分辨率有限，实际机制需宏基因组或代谢组学进一步验证。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f00adc5887ecf0a203fed018\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0017\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"no complete research body was indexed\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"local source was absent or unreadable\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"abstract_only\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::8b8d965f22f748d8aea31126\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::293eb3790a6ab7b71a0f7938\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ac4a925240c145b25c1cbb1a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7b5fdca1762c4a1844c7341f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用混合研究设计：1. 临床观察性研究：前瞻性收集93份来自37名抗PD-1治疗肺癌患者的粪便样本，以及61份来自33名发生irAEs的多癌种患者样本。使用16S rDNA扩增子测序进行微生物组分析，计算α/β多样性，使用LEfSe识别差异菌属，并通过随机森林算法构建irAE预测模型。2. 动物因果验证：将C57BL/6小鼠经抗生素鸡尾酒处理清除原有菌群后，分别移植来自有结肠炎型irAE患者和无irAE患者的粪便菌群。随后给予抗PD-1和抗CTLA-4单抗诱导免疫反应，评估结肠炎发生率、疾病活动指数、组织病理学及炎症因子表达。3. 功能机制推测：基于16S数据使用Tax4fun和KEGG数据库预测微生物功能通路，重点关注短链脂肪酸（如丁酸）产生菌丰度及代谢途径差异。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::56a251bb4bf2e70d9046ac70\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了在非黑色素瘤实体瘤（主要是肺癌）背景下，肠道微生物群与irAEs发生的关联证据；区分了结肠炎型与非结肠炎型irAEs的微生物特征差异；通过人源化小鼠FMT实验提供了微生物群导致免疫性结肠炎的因果证据；识别出丁酸产生菌丰度降低可能与irAEs发生有关。\",\n          \"limits\": \"样本量较小（最终纳入分析的无irAE组34人，irAE组32人），可能导致统计效力不足或过拟合风险；仅使用16S rDNA测序进行功能预测，缺乏宏基因组或代谢组学的直接验证；基线前ICI治疗前的粪便样本获取困难，限制了基线状态的全面分析；无法完全排除irAEs本身对微生物群的扰动影响（尽管FMT支持因果方向）；预测模型需外部独立队列验证。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::370e1997ec04811460303373\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"抗PD-1治疗后出现irAEs的患者 vs 未出现irAEs的患者\",\n          \"finding\": \"微生物组成显著不同（P=0.001）。irAE患者中双歧杆菌（Bifidobacterium）、粪杆菌属（Faecalibacterium）和阿加索细菌属（Agathobacter）丰度较低，而红球菌属（Erysipelatoclostridium）丰度较高。主要丁酸产生菌总丰度在irAE患者中更低（P=0.007）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f62b887d1b251fb36e63bda9\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"结肠炎型irAE患者 vs 非结肠炎型irAE患者\",\n          \"finding\": \"微生物组成显著不同（P=0.003）。结肠炎型患者中拟杆菌属（Bacteroides）和双歧杆菌丰度较低，肠球菌属（Enterococcus）丰度较高。主要丁酸产生菌丰度也较低（P=0.018）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5d30a37ab62a73ee8b4c7454\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"小鼠FMT实验（结肠炎型irAE供体 vs 无irAE供体）+ 抗PD-1/CTLA-4治疗\",\n          \"finding\": \"结肠炎型irAE-FMT组小鼠中3/9发展为致命性严重结肠炎，而非irAE-FMT组0/9发病。结肠炎小鼠表现为体重下降更快、DAI评分更高、结肠缩短、组织损伤更重，且结肠组织中Il6和Tnf mRNA水平升高。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::10c3dff98fb8682a1dccf79f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"irAE预测模型构建\",\n          \"finding\": \"基于10个主要差异菌属（以Gemella, Dubosiella, Atopobium为主）的随机森林模型在训练集AUC为86.4%，测试集AUC为91.7%。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3ae97f7b7005bd50f7ba304f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::684b173aec03df76f4198b59\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管已知肠道微生物群影响ICI疗效，但其作为irAEs发生和严重程度的角色及其因果关系尚未确立。特别是针对除黑色素瘤以外的其他癌症类型（如肺癌），以及不同器官受累的irAEs，微生物群的差异特征和作用机制尚不明确。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5f0274b3487f40b29fe60c92\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究对象为接受抗PD-1治疗的晚期胸廓恶性肿瘤（主要为肺癌）患者，以及发生免疫相关不良反应（irAEs）的多种实体瘤患者。研究情境包括临床队列观察和基于人类粪便微生物移植（FMT）的小鼠实验。范围涵盖不同严重程度和器官类型的irAEs，重点聚焦于结肠炎型irAEs。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f157d433e5f5ba636b80c1ac\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在探讨肠道微生物群与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗引发的免疫相关不良反应（irAEs）之间的关联及因果关系。研究首先通过16S rDNA测序分析了接受抗PD-1治疗的肺癌患者及发生irAEs的其他癌症患者的粪便样本，比较了有无irAEs、不同严重程度（1-2级 vs 3-4级）以及不同部位（结肠炎型 vs 非结肠炎型）患者间的微生物组成差异，并构建了预测模型。随后，通过抗生素预处理小鼠并进行来自不同患者组的FMT，结合抗PD-1/CTLA-4抗体治疗，验证微生物群对免疫性结肠炎的因果作用。最后，利用功能预测分析探讨了潜在的代谢机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d89e4d7c6b3d84ae3a62e9b4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"样本局限于晚期胸廓肿瘤和多癌种irAE患者，结果可能不适用于所有ICI药物（如抗CTLA-4单药）或早期癌症人群。预测模型未经外部验证。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道微生物群组成与ICI治疗安全性（irAEs发生）的直接关联数据。具体显示irAE患者中特定有益菌（双歧杆菌、粪杆菌、阿加索细菌）减少，有害菌（红球菌属）增加。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::65232b9dd11887f7c3c947ee\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"小鼠模型使用了抗生素预处理和联合抗体治疗，与人体的生理状态存在差异。功能分析仅为基于16S的预测，非直接代谢物测量。并非所有接受FMT的小鼠都发病，表明其他宿主因素也参与。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"通过FMT小鼠实验证明了来自irAE患者的微生物群能够因果性地诱导免疫性结肠炎。同时指出丁酸产生菌丰度降低和特定代谢通路（如氨基酸、维生素代谢）的差异，提示代谢机制可能在介导irAEs中起作用。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::57b8483e9f9cd672d266dba2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"论文引言部分回顾了微生物群在ICI疗效中的作用，并指出目前研究多集中于黑色素瘤，强调本研究扩展至肺癌等其他实体瘤的重要性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::97d2a1c8337589808f154b48\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"论文讨论了Faecalibacterium在不同研究中的矛盾结果（有的报道保护，有的报道促炎），并归因于情境依赖性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8a0a5e2ac2060afd26a3d218\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究的因果证据仅限于小鼠模型中的结肠炎表型，不能直接外推至人体所有irAEs的发生机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f23786cce1eeced11074defa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"预测模型的AUC值基于内部验证，可能存在过拟合，实际临床应用价值需进一步确认。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::821df0a3c6305c95bb399a78\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"功能预测基于16S数据，准确性低于宏基因组测序，代谢通路的差异仅为推测，需代谢组学验证。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::68071cd7d3b466b520eab039\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"样本量较小，特别是严重irAEs亚组分析可能缺乏统计效力。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::43b7ecec9c980646e0f0b9dc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"auxiliary_material\": \"研究建立了 irAE 预测模型（训练集 AUC 86.4%，测试集 91.7%），但该模型针对的是广义 irAE 发生，未针对特定器官毒性进行验证。小鼠 FMT 实验证实了来自结肠炎 irAE 患者的微生物群可因果性诱导小鼠免疫性结肠炎，但未涉及非结肠炎表型的因果验证。功能预测显示丁酸产生菌在 irAE 患者中丰度降低，提示代谢机制可能参与，但这基于 16S 预测而非直接代谢组测量。\",\n          \"evidence\": [],\n          \"gap_id\": \"Ch6_gap_5\",\n          \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\chapters\\\\external\\\\N4452dfb25f491e9335fe-5a6b848383c152a3\\\\round_1\\\\supplements\\\\Ch6_gap_5\\\\attempt-fc662a0y\\\\source_units\\\\SU03_search_candidate_cef6ae84bc\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n          \"limitations\": [],\n          \"material_ready\": true,\n          \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n          \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"remaining_gap\": \"目前仍缺乏针对特定非结肠炎 irAEs（如心肌炎、神经毒性）的大规模微生物组关联研究。现有研究（包括本研究）通常将非结肠炎 irAEs 合并分析，或因特定类型病例数过少（如本研究仅 3 例心肌炎）而无法得出具有统计效力的结论，无法充分验证或解决 P0051 和 P0530 中提到的证据不足问题。\",\n          \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"status\": \"unmet\",\n          \"useful_material\": \"该研究纳入了 32 名发生 irAEs 的患者进行微生物组分析，其中非结肠炎 irAEs 被归为一组进行分析。在具体 irAE 类型分布中，38 例 irAE 事件包含 3 例心肌炎（myocarditis），但未对心肌炎或神经毒性等特定非结肠炎类型进行独立的微生物组关联分析。作者在讨论部分明确指出，由于样本量相对较小且 irAE 发生率总体较低，亚组分析（如比较不同类型 irAE 患者的微生物组）可能缺乏统计效力或无法进行（'subgroup analyses may have lacked statistical power or were not possible, for instance for comparing the microbiota of patients with different types of irAE'）。该研究证实了结肠炎与非结肠炎 irAEs 之间的微生物组存在整体差异，但未能提供针对特定非结肠炎 irAEs（如心肌炎）的大规模独立数据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0ae65bd0a736c1c537cf2b1c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_materials\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": [\n          {\n            \"auxiliary_material\": \"研究建立了 irAE 预测模型（训练集 AUC 86.4%，测试集 91.7%），但该模型针对的是广义 irAE 发生，未针对特定器官毒性进行验证。小鼠 FMT 实验证实了来自结肠炎 irAE 患者的微生物群可因果性诱导小鼠免疫性结肠炎，但未涉及非结肠炎表型的因果验证。功能预测显示丁酸产生菌在 irAE 患者中丰度降低，提示代谢机制可能参与，但这基于 16S 预测而非直接代谢组测量。\",\n            \"evidence\": [],\n            \"gap_id\": \"Ch6_gap_5\",\n            \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\chapters\\\\external\\\\N4452dfb25f491e9335fe-5a6b848383c152a3\\\\round_1\\\\supplements\\\\Ch6_gap_5\\\\attempt-fc662a0y\\\\source_units\\\\SU03_search_candidate_cef6ae84bc\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n            \"limitations\": [],\n            \"material_ready\": true,\n            \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n            \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"remaining_gap\": \"目前仍缺乏针对特定非结肠炎 irAEs（如心肌炎、神经毒性）的大规模微生物组关联研究。现有研究（包括本研究）通常将非结肠炎 irAEs 合并分析，或因特定类型病例数过少（如本研究仅 3 例心肌炎）而无法得出具有统计效力的结论，无法充分验证或解决 P0051 和 P0530 中提到的证据不足问题。\",\n            \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n            \"status\": \"unmet\",\n            \"useful_material\": \"该研究纳入了 32 名发生 irAEs 的患者进行微生物组分析，其中非结肠炎 irAEs 被归为一组进行分析。在具体 irAE 类型分布中，38 例 irAE 事件包含 3 例心肌炎（myocarditis），但未对心肌炎或神经毒性等特定非结肠炎类型进行独立的微生物组关联分析。作者在讨论部分明确指出，由于样本量相对较小且 irAE 发生率总体较低，亚组分析（如比较不同类型 irAE 患者的微生物组）可能缺乏统计效力或无法进行（'subgroup analyses may have lacked statistical power or were not possible, for instance for comparing the microbiota of patients with different types of irAE'）。该研究证实了结肠炎与非结肠炎 irAEs 之间的微生物组存在整体差异，但未能提供针对特定非结肠炎 irAEs（如心肌炎）的大规模独立数据。\"\n          }\n        ],\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::41536b078798585a9f6cf46f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0600\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::764ddb58c7d47204119c72b5\",\n          \"snapshot::715592e26e584e7d4af212b0\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::73a2d408717e6398f3fd9093\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e39394a998d94b0e9c10cc2e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::94d50912fa44c41d58ffaf18\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"前瞻性队列研究设计。纳入95例接受PD-1/PD-L1抑制剂（单药或联合CTLA-4抑制剂）治疗的GI癌症患者。收集基线粪便样本进行宏基因组鸟枪法测序。使用MaAsLin2进行差异物种和通路分析，PERMANOVA评估混杂因素，Wilcoxon秩和检验比较组间差异。按irAE严重程度（轻症vs重症）、癌症类型（食管/胃/结肠）及特定器官毒性（皮肤/血液/内分泌/肝脏）进行分层分析。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8e654486045065fb54b27c79\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了胃肠道癌症（食管、胃、结肠）背景下，基线肠道微生物组与irAEs发生及严重程度的具体关联谱，包括特定菌种（如R. callidus, B. xylanisolvens）和代谢通路（尿素循环）。揭示了不同癌症类型和器官特异性毒性具有独特的微生物特征。\",\n          \"limits\": \"样本量较小（n=95），缺乏外部验证队列。未进行因果机制的实验验证（如动物模型或体外实验）。结果主要基于相关性分析，无法确立因果关系。不同癌症类型的异质性可能导致微生物标志物的特异性较强，通用性受限。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::53bef823014e951415c37a47\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"所有GI癌症患者总体比较（有vs无irAEs）\",\n          \"finding\": \"整体α和β多样性无显著差异。Clostridium hathewayi, Ruminococcus torques等富集于无irAEs组；Bifidobacterium dentium, Rothia mucilaginosa等富集于irAEs组。尿素循环（PWY-4984）和瓜氨酸生物合成通路富集于无irAEs组。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d43d4aced5ec8f4e8c1052fe\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"irAEs严重程度比较（轻症Grade 1-2 vs 重症Grade ≥3）\",\n          \"finding\": \"Ruminococcus callidus和Bacteroides xylanisolvens在无重症irAEs患者中显著富集，有助于区分重症人群。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0e0d6cd2fb9007d7666a16f8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"不同癌症类型分层\",\n          \"finding\": \"食管癌：R. torques富集于无irAEs组，Dialister invisus富集于高irAE组；谷氨酰胺生物合成通路在高irAE组富集。胃癌：乳酸杆菌科、双歧杆菌科等益生菌及丁酸产生菌富集于无/低irAE组。结肠癌：Bacteroides stercoris富集于高irAE组；精氨酸生物合成通路在低irAE组富集。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f913c3f2f3b926febe78b1c5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"特定器官毒性比较\",\n          \"finding\": \"皮肤毒性：甘油降解和尿素循环通路富集于无皮肤irAEs组。血液毒性：尿素循环和瓜氨酸生物合成通路富集于无血液irAEs组。内分泌毒性：肠铁菌素生物合成通路富集于无内分泌irAEs组。肝脏毒性：尿素循环和瓜氨酸生物合成通路富集于无肝毒性irAEs组。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f85690019a26dd19cc3fcb35\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c965085c365ae58f031b3902\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"探究肠道微生物组是否以及如何与胃肠道癌症患者接受免疫检查点抑制剂治疗后发生的免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）相关联，识别潜在的预测性生物标志物和代谢机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::addc034e2e5b3e12e9cdb012\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"95例接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的晚期/不可切除胃肠道癌症（食管癌、胃癌、结直肠癌）患者；基线粪便样本宏基因组测序；分析肠道微生物组与免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的关联。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::af989328995494c8922ca744\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究是一项前瞻性观察研究，旨在探讨肠道微生物组与胃肠道癌症患者接受免疫治疗引发的免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）之间的关联。研究纳入了95名完成基线粪便采样且仅接受单一或联合PD-1/PD-L1抑制剂治疗的患者，通过宏基因组测序分析其基线微生物组成及代谢通路。结果显示，整体微生物多样性在有无irAEs患者间无显著差异，但特定菌种和代谢通路存在差异：Ruminococcus callidus和Bacteroides xylanisolvens在无严重irAEs患者中富集，而某些致病菌或条件致病菌在irAEs患者中升高。此外，尿素循环及相关氨基酸合成通路与irAEs发生有关，且不同癌症类型和特定器官毒性（如皮肤、血液、内分泌、肝脏）表现出不同的微生物特征。该研究为理解irAEs的微生物机制提供了基础数据，但缺乏外部验证队列和实验验证。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e386fd22d8c544b9c1efcca4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅限于相关性，不能证明因果。样本来自单一中心，可能存在选择偏倚。未涵盖所有类型的固体瘤。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了胃肠道癌症患者中，基线微生物组成与irAEs发生风险的关联证据。具体指出Ruminococcus callidus和Bacteroides xylanisolvens的富集与较低的重症irAEs风险相关，而某些细菌（如B. dentium, R. mucilaginosa）的升高与irAEs发生相关。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4f793f32a90597b4a0d249f5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"代谢通路的富集是观察性结果，作者承认缺乏实验验证来确认这些通路直接导致或保护免受irAEs。引用的机制多来自其他疾病模型或癌种，需注明外推的不确定性。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了微生物代谢功能可能介导irAEs的线索。发现尿素循环（urea cycle）及瓜氨酸/精氨酸生物合成通路在无irAEs或低毒性患者中富集。讨论了精氨酸代谢在免疫调节中的潜在作用，并引用了其他研究中益生菌（如乳酸杆菌、双歧杆菌）通过调节Treg细胞或IL-10缓解炎症的机制。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5aee41876112ff2a057ab15f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"研究发现不同癌症类型（食管、胃、结肠）的irAEs具有截然不同的微生物特征。例如，胃癌中益生菌（乳酸杆菌、双歧杆菌）富集与低毒性相关，而结肠癌中Bacteroides stercoris与高毒性相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2f42765cef9e604f49119b34\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"作者指出既往黑色素瘤研究中发现的多样性降低现象在本研究中未观察到，并推测可能与测序方法、队列特征或治疗方案差异有关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::53e25ff0f999e6004f67b148\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究仅涉及胃肠道癌症，其发现的微生物标志物（如R. callidus的保护作用）可能不适用于黑色素瘤、肺癌等其他实体瘤，需谨慎外推。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ad9eb949fb4daac44d9fc828\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"所有发现均为基线微生物组与irAEs的相关性，未建立因果链条。代谢通路的结论仅为假设，需实验验证。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::76c9481a976505f7c9ecab68\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"样本量有限（n=95），且排除了联合抗生素治疗或未能提供基线样本的患者，可能存在选择偏倚。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e3a1705b198b0cca49beb1c6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"irAEs的定义和分级依据CTCAE v4.03，需注意与其他研究使用的标准可能存在的细微差异。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::674c199cb19bd8a62ce5a60b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0011\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-4dcc7c19ae5301df5638\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-5c752c0f8036d5742e42\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-76494e52e6aac1a4278f\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-a7194a689f46f19f0fc9\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-5f82ba52a99d38e52a55\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"assets\",\n              \"reason\": \"supplementaryFiles_fetch_transport_TimeoutError\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::9434601012338f320affc14b\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::35edca5bdc58a12eb6042045\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bcfeb64c2b546944ce14831a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::873653225ac3d94f9fee6560\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用多阶段混合方法：1) 数据整合与预处理：从公共数据库提取7项研究的16S数据，结合内部收集的16S和宏基因组数据；使用MMUPHin算法对“研究”这一主要混杂因素进行批次校正。2) 差异分析与特征筛选：使用阻塞Wilcoxon秩和检验识别差异物种，排除与疗效（response）重叠的特征，保留irAEs特异性特征。3) 机器学习建模：使用随机森林（Random Forest）算法，通过迭代特征消除（IFE）优化，筛选出最具判别力的14个微生物特征构建RF14分类器。4) 模型评估：通过分层十折交叉验证、留一法验证（LOSO）及两个独立外部队列（SH和JS队列）评估模型性能（AUC、敏感性、特异性等）。5) 机制探索：利用PICRUSt2预测功能，结合宏基因组数据验证关键基因（menH, menC）表达，并通过qRT-PCR和HPLC-MS/MS定量粪便样本中的基因丰度和血清中的甲萘醌水平；最后结合结肠组织转录组数据进行GSEA分析以推断炎症通路机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::24339fdba7a3beeae5bb9d0b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了一个经过严格外部验证的、基于14种微生物的irAEs预测模型（RF14），解决了既往研究结果不一致的问题，并指出了特定微生物（如乳酸杆菌）作为潜在生物标志物的价值。\",\n          \"limits\": \"机制部分主要基于观察性数据的关联分析和文献推导，缺乏直接的体内或体外实验证实甲萘醌对irAEs的具体因果作用；样本量虽经整合但仍有限，且未完全控制所有临床混杂因素（如抗生素使用细节、具体肿瘤类型差异等）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6e3aea46111b008f2e807480\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"整合3项大规模anti-PD-1/PD-L1队列（n=190）进行训练\",\n          \"finding\": \"识别出14种微生物特征构成的RF14分类器，区分irAEs与非irAEs的平均AUC为0.88；其中Lactobacillus salivarius为排名最高的生物标志物。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0c8da7cfe4b7d6b35e1263aa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"两个独立外部队列验证（SH队列N=65，JS队列N=50）\",\n          \"finding\": \"RF14分类器在两个独立队列中均显示出显著的判别能力，证明了模型的跨队列泛化性和稳健性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::df9a4cb408e8af81702d5567\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"功能分析与代谢物检测\",\n          \"finding\": \"非irAEs患者肠道微生物中甲萘醌（Menaquinone/Vitamin K2）生物合成途径显著富集，关键限速酶menH和menC表达升高；血清中甲萘醌水平在非irAEs患者中显著高于irAEs患者。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b1e8085158f4858a558996ef\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"机制推断（结合转录组数据）\",\n          \"finding\": \"低RF评分（高风险irAEs）组患者结肠组织中促炎通路（如NF-κB信号通路）显著激活；文献支持甲萘醌可抑制NF-κB通路，提示微生物来源的甲萘醌可能通过抗炎机制保护宿主免受irAEs损伤。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cf3ef56f614496fc53563362\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f284a3f55120c4d9be9d82b8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管已知肠道微生物组影响ICIs引发的irAEs，但不同研究报道的微生物关联存在不一致性，缺乏高鲁棒性的预测生物标志物及明确的机制解释。本研究试图回答：能否从整合数据中识别出稳定预测anti-PD-1/PD-L1治疗相关irAEs的微生物特征？这些微生物特征背后的功能机制是什么？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9f268b67ab84227a5bde91fa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"接受抗PD-1/PD-L1免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）治疗的实体瘤患者；研究聚焦于基线肠道微生物组与免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）发生风险之间的关联，以及潜在的代谢机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6a632fec1bedc7f321c9802b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在解决现有研究中肠道微生物组与irAEs关联不一致的问题，通过整合公开数据与内部队列，构建基于机器学习的微生物预测模型并探索其生物学机制。研究团队收集了来自7项已发表研究的317名患者的16S rRNA测序数据，以及来自上海和徐州两家医院的115名患者的内部队列数据（包括16S和宏基因组）。首先，通过元分析校正“研究”带来的批次效应，识别出区分irAEs与非irAEs的特异性微生物特征。随后，利用随机森林算法筛选出14种关键微生物物种，构建了RF14分类器，在训练集上达到0.88的AUC，并在两个独立外部队列中验证了其稳健性。此外，研究结合转录组与宏基因组数据，发现非irAEs患者肠道中维生素K2（甲萘醌/menaquinone）的生物合成途径及关键酶（menH, menC）表达显著升高，且血清中甲萘醌水平更高。机制推测表明，微生物来源的甲萘醌可能通过抑制NF-κB等促炎信号通路来减轻irAEs的发生。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3f5d7b9532842831db5ba214\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"该模型主要针对anti-PD-1/PD-L1治疗，对于anti-CTLA-4或其他联合疗法的适用性需参考文中提到的其他数据集或保持谨慎外推。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了基于14种微生物特征的irAEs预测模型（RF14），显示非irAEs患者中特定菌属（如Lactobacillus, Parabacteroides）富集。这直接回应了微生物组如何影响ICIs安全性（毒性）的问题，表明特定的微生物组成可以作为风险分层工具。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bac4dadcab9216e74454e8af\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"机制证据主要为相关性（微生物丰度、基因表达、血清代谢物与临床表型的关联）和文献支持的通路推断，尚未通过干预实验确证因果关系。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"揭示了微生物组影响irAEs的潜在机制：非irAEs患者中甲萘醌（Vitamin K2）生物合成增强，且血清中甲萘醌水平更高；关联分析提示甲萘醌可能通过抑制NF-κB促炎通路发挥作用。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3571b0e723fd78824b65d9db\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"文中指出既往研究因样本量小、治疗策略差异导致微生物关联结果不一致，本研究通过大样本整合和批次校正解决了这一问题。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5a8fd506671133aadd947532\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"文中提到irAEs患者往往有更好的生存获益，因此预防irAEs而不影响疗效是临床难题；提出补充甲萘醌可能是一种选择性治疗策略。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::eeb73bd49837d90afbda3f95\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究重点在于irAEs（毒性）而非肿瘤疗效（efficacy），虽然提到了排除与疗效重叠的特征，但其核心贡献是预测毒性风险。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::89ee0ec6e1e7c0f00b3e09fd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"机制部分（甲萘醌-NF-κB）是基于观察性数据和文献引用的推断，不能直接视为已证实的因果机制，需在综述中明确其假设性质。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5bb58ef19cd0981fada89e44\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"模型验证使用了独立的16S和宏基因组队列，但未包含所有类型的ICI药物（如单药抗CTLA-4仅用于初步比较，模型主要针对PD-1/PD-L1）。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3d73946efd2865bc1e459d0a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0308\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::cba66b07106aef6edf937b84\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::aaf98f91add3d9c5573cff59\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"structured_partial\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::95fe68848db0177e2d9044c2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6448e9e5b0208bc6be940ba3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"作为一篇综述，本研究采用文献综述的方法，对已发表的关于ICIs诱导的irAEs预测生物标志物的研究进行系统性整理和归纳。具体路线包括：1. 将潜在生物标志物按类别进行分类（血液细胞计数/表面标记、血清蛋白、自身抗体、细胞因子/趋化因子、遗传变异/基因表达、HLA基因型、microRNAs、肠道微生物组及其他如BMI）。2. 针对每一类，提取并总结代表性研究的设计类型（回顾性或前瞻性）、样本量、肿瘤类型、具体的生物标志物指标、观察到的关联方向（正相关或负相关）以及统计学显著性。3. 对比不同研究间结果的异同，特别关注矛盾发现。4. 综合讨论各类标志物的临床可行性、特异性问题（如受癌症本身炎症影响）及机制解释。5. 基于现有证据的整体质量，评估其向临床转化所需的条件（如需要更多前瞻性验证）。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::eb2b8fbc4af35b9b2c9ca1f2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了关于ICIs诱导irAEs预测生物标志物的全面分类综述，涵盖了从常规实验室检测到前沿分子特征的广泛领域。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代具体的文献检索策略、纳入排除标准及偏倚风险评估方法，仅呈现了作者的归纳观点。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::05791142a284303824abe255\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"明确指出了当前生物标志物研究的主要局限性：结果不一致、缺乏特异性（受肿瘤炎症干扰）、多为回顾性研究、以及缺乏临床实用性的验证。\",\n          \"limits\": \"作为综述，其结论依赖于所引用的原始研究的质量和设计，无法提供新的实证数据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ac0eba0a8b72df7ef1d376ab\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了生物标志物可能同时预测irAE风险和抗肿瘤疗效的假设，为未来研究方向提供了思路。\",\n          \"limits\": \"该假设尚需更多研究证实，目前仅是基于个别研究的推测。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9c2ff752cd56f38240a96868\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"血液细胞计数与比率（回顾性为主，多肿瘤类型）\",\n          \"finding\": \"多项回顾性研究显示基线或治疗期间的白细胞、中性粒细胞、淋巴细胞、嗜酸性粒细胞、单核细胞及其比值（如NLR, PLR）与irAEs风险存在关联，但结果高度不一致。例如，部分研究发现低基线淋巴细胞计数预示高风险，而其他研究则发现高计数或治疗后升高与风险相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c55bb20d1969796d60d640a6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"血清蛋白（CRP, LDH, Albumin等）\",\n          \"finding\": \"C反应蛋白（CRP）的研究结果矛盾：有的显示irAE发作时短暂升高，有的显示基线低水平与irAE发生独立相关。其他蛋白如LDH和白蛋白也显示出不一致的结果。器官特异性蛋白（如心肌酶谱、甲状腺激素）在特定irAEs中显示出较好的相关性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9d3d6d15e8c760a46b53e081\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"自身抗体（ANA, 甲状腺抗体等）\",\n          \"finding\": \"基线存在自身抗体（如ANA、抗甲状腺抗体）可能与某些irAEs（如内分泌功能障碍）的风险增加有关，但也有一些研究未发现这种关联，甚至发现基线抗体滴度较低者反而风险更高。自身抗体可能更多反映预先存在的自身免疫倾向而非直接预测新发irAEs。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f4e705878e96a2a175972cf1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"细胞因子/趋化因子（IL-1, IL-6, IL-10, CXCL9等）\",\n          \"finding\": \"多种促炎和抗炎细胞因子与irAEs相关，但方向不一。例如，IL-6基线高水平在某些研究中是风险因素，而在另一项黑色素瘤研究中低风险与高irAE发生率相关。CXCL9/CXCL10等趋化因子在治疗后升高与irAEs发生相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9202f18ba63842bbe31e8043\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基因变异与表达（SNPs, HLA, miRNAs）\",\n          \"finding\": \"特定基因多态性（如PDCD1, SYK, IL7）和HLA基因型（如HLA-DRB1*11:01与瘙痒，HLA-DQB1*03:01与结肠炎）与特定irAEs风险相关，但不同研究间存在冲突（如HLA-DQB1*03:01对结肠炎的保护或易感作用）。miRNA（如miR-146a）在严重irAEs中表达降低，但研究数量较少。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ad2193d5428b989ee801e640\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"肠道微生物组\",\n          \"finding\": \"肠道菌群组成与irAEs有关联，但结果不一致且难以复现。例如，Agathobacter丰度降低在某些研究中与irAEs相关，而在另一些研究中与更严重的irAEs相关。粪便样本采集困难限制了其广泛应用。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f4ee43ed31aa893dc3ef1d24\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a05eb717b269685717335fe6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"当前ICIs治疗中，由于irAEs的发生具有多样性、不可预测性和严重性，且可能影响治疗连续性和患者生活质量，临床急需有效的预测生物标志物以实现早期识别和干预。然而，现有研究中提出的众多潜在生物标志物结果不一致，且缺乏临床实用性。因此，本研究旨在回答：目前有哪些潜在的生物标志物被提出用于预测irAEs？它们的证据强度如何？存在哪些主要局限性和不一致性？\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::874ec0197cd7611fd1abbf91\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）治疗的癌症患者，重点关注预测和管理免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的生物标志物。涵盖多种肿瘤类型（如黑色素瘤、非小细胞肺癌、肾细胞癌等），涉及血液学指标、血清蛋白、自身抗体、细胞因子/趋化因子、基因变异、基因表达谱、HLA基因型、microRNAs及肠道微生物组等多个维度的潜在生物标志物。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::647e35c3c5f2baefcc16e580\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本文是一篇综述，旨在系统梳理和评估目前用于预测和管理ICIs治疗期间发生的irAEs的各种潜在生物标志物。文章首先介绍了irAEs的临床背景及其对治疗的影响，随后分类详细讨论了各类生物标志物的研究现状、关联发现及局限性。作者指出，尽管已有大量研究探索了从常规血液检测到复杂分子特征的多种标志物，但由于研究结果的不一致性、缺乏特异性以及多为回顾性研究的局限，目前尚无经过充分验证并可用于常规临床实践的单一或组合生物标志物。文章最后强调了未来需要大规模前瞻性研究来验证这些标志物的效力，并探讨了生物标志物在同时预测irAE风险和抗肿瘤疗效方面的潜力。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c48d388bf7a8a44d386d7518\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"该综述并未深入探讨微生物组调节ICIs疗效的具体分子机制，也未专门聚焦于实体瘤中微生物组与药物疗效的直接因果链条，而是将其置于irAEs预测的 broader context 中。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道微生物组作为irAEs预测生物标志物的现状概述，包括具体菌属（如Agathobacter）与irAEs关联的矛盾发现，以及粪便样本采集的挑战。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e837fdef16698a71a14bf2b4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"不能直接从本综述中提取微生物组调节免疫的具体机制细节，只能获得宏观层面的免疫参与线索。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"虽然没有直接阐述微生物组的机制，但综述中提到的其他生物标志物（如T细胞受体多样性、细胞因子网络、HLA基因型）揭示了宿主免疫系统在irAEs发生中的核心作用。这间接提示，如果微生物组要影响irAEs，很可能也是通过调制宿主免疫反应（如T细胞激活、细胞因子释放）来实现的。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5afddce1617492b7a7f0caf0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"综述指出目前无确立的生物标志物，原因包括结果不一致、回顾性研究为主、缺乏特异性等。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f6ad7f2c394e73289b4dcfb1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"综述比较了血液检测（简便但特异性低）、分子特征（昂贵但可能更特异）等不同类别标志物的特点。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a6b5a8c48a505a5d0340d2b5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"综述提到irAEs的发生通常与更好的治疗效果相关，且某些生物标志物可能同时预测两者。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e02fc654b2294aa8dd4c70bc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该综述主要关注irAEs的预测，而非ICIs疗效的直接预测，尽管二者有联系。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a88a24166742d3e4a45d6f52\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"文中关于微生物组的描述较为简略，且强调结果不一致，不应将其视为对微生物组作用的定论。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6d4d646a7541b6b8783730db\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"综述中的许多发现来自回顾性研究，因果推断需谨慎。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3de57eb0f4d3a295576a2da6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"不同肿瘤类型和ICI药物可能导致生物标志物表现不同，应用时需考虑情境依赖性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9222fc126fbbb5572476924f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0312\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"html\",\n              \"reason\": \"html_challenge_or_login\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"html\",\n              \"known_losses\": [\n                \"headings/tables/math/image pixels are not preserved by this plain HTML projection\"\n              ],\n              \"reason\": \"body converted to structured material; headings/tables/math/image pixels may be lost\",\n              \"status\": \"derived\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"structured_partial\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::e5098f056730d4765c7de819\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a206a96a782032cc169d8b1d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::830348bc4ff460e98754073d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::34fba25ca01d8cc9a99d4b85\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用前瞻性队列设计。收集接受ICI治疗的癌症患者粪便样本。使用16S rRNA测序和MGS进行微生物组分析。定义七个基于文献的预设细菌组（包括致病菌组和Ruminococcaceae等）。使用多种统计工具（ANCOM-BC, LinDA, MaAsLin2, ALDEx2）进行差异丰度分析，以寻找跨工具一致的结果。通过逻辑回归和线性混合效应模型评估细菌组与严重irAE的关联，并校正ICI类型。比较有/无严重irAE患者在基线、治疗早期、irAE发作时及免疫抑制后的微生物组特征。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::81d1197be7aa905b288e7880\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了大样本（195例）前瞻性数据，证实了Ruminococcaceae科的动态减少与严重irAE的相关性，特别是在irAE发作时的显著降低。\",\n          \"limits\": \"基线致病菌组的高RA关联在多重检验校正后不显著；部分低丰度菌群的差异结果需谨慎解读；无法区分菌株特异性效应；样本量对于解析复杂的多重交互作用仍显不足。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c2a3cf5d3e5f4ec9f74e46c7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基线（ICI治疗前）\",\n          \"finding\": \"发生严重irAE的患者中，预设的致病菌组（pathobionts）平均RA显著高于未发生者（8.2% vs 4.8%; OR 1.40; 95%CI 1.07-1.87），但该关联在多重检验校正后失去统计学显著性（校正p=0.059）。Ruminococcaceae科在两组间基线RA无显著差异。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::945c11493df532310035578f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"治疗早期（从基线到第2周期）\",\n          \"finding\": \"发生严重irAE的患者中，Ruminococcaceae科的RA下降幅度显著大于未发生者（交互作用粗p=0.018，校正p=0.123）。然而，发生组内的下降本身未达到统计学显著性（粗p=0.078）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4a8e73e66868ae4bfdc82e5a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"严重irAE发作时\",\n          \"finding\": \"与所有其他时间点相比，发生严重irAE的患者中Ruminococcaceae科、Ruminococcus属以及R. bromii和R. callidus物种的RA显著降低。Haemophilus属及其种H. parainfluenzae在irAE发作时的RA显著升高。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a7ef9c7e8453fccfc36f88ca\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::be70156d57df0f79b02acfcc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管已知肠道微生物组可能影响ICI疗效，但其与严重irAEs的关联尚不明确，且既往研究结果存在冲突。本研究试图确定基线微生物特征或治疗期间的动态变化是否能预测严重irAEs，并探索潜在的病理生理机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6ead9f1dbcba31cf6e1fc85d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"荷兰乌得勒支大学医学中心进行的UNI-CIT前瞻性生物库研究中的癌症患者。研究对象为接受一线抗PD-1单药或抗PD-1联合抗CTLA-4治疗的实体瘤患者（主要为黑色素瘤和非小细胞肺癌）。样本包括治疗前基线、治疗早期（第2-3周期）、严重irAE发作时及免疫抑制治疗后的粪便样本。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::68f4a1a3b76d7493fee0802b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在评估肠道微生物组在免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗开始时的组成及其在治疗过程中的变化，是否与随后发生的严重免疫相关不良事件（irAEs，≥3级）相关。通过对195名患者的497个粪便样本进行16S rRNA基因测序和宏基因组鸟枪法测序（MGS），分析α/β多样性、特定分类群相对丰度（RA）及预设细菌组的差异。研究发现，虽然基线时致病菌组（pathobionts）的RA较高与严重irAE风险增加有关（但在多重检验校正后不再显著），但Ruminococcaceae科在发生严重irAE的患者中表现出更显著的下降趋势，且在irAE发作时其RA显著低于其他时间点。这表明以Ruminococcaceae减少为特征的微生物组失调可能预示严重irAE的发生。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c252b5474d64d364cd7f3860\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅观察性关联，非因果证明；主要关注毒性而非直接疗效指标（如ORR/PFS）；结果受多重检验校正影响。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了肠道微生物组组成变化与ICI疗效/毒性关联的观察性证据。具体发现Ruminococcaceae科的减少与严重irAEs相关，提示微生物组状态可能调节宿主对ICI的反应谱（不仅限于抗肿瘤疗效，还包括毒性）。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4b929c4295eb40cb9ab14192\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"机制推断为主，缺乏直接的分子机制验证（如代谢物测量或动物实验验证）；F. prausnitzii的具体作用在该研究中未得到明确支持（基线无差异）。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"探讨了可能的机制线索：致病菌组富集和有益菌（Ruminococcaceae）减少导致的菌群失调（dysbiosis）可能促进炎症反应，从而引发irAEs。特别讨论了F. prausnitzii（产丁酸菌）在不同研究中的矛盾结果，暗示菌株特异性的重要性。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c9e0c551a9d37a02eb4f0f53\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"基线致病菌组高RA与irAE风险的初步关联（虽校正后不显著，但趋势一致），以及H. parainfluenzae在irAE发作时的升高。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::502a1b75a3903dd2b24ac4cc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"对F. prausnitzii在既往研究中矛盾结果的详细讨论。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::11ce7c664c3b850176ec33d3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"基线致病菌组与irAE的关联在多重检验校正后不显著，不能视为确证的保护/风险因素，仅为趋势。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::814cd23e6d1aeafff2edd99d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Ruminococcaceae的减少是观察到的关联，不等于因果关系；可能是irAE的前驱标志或伴随现象。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ed2d9a5123e9b1e366665fa1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"低丰度菌群（如Marvinbryantia, Haemophilus）的差异结果可能存在技术噪音，需谨慎引用。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6f03e8ddcc9115afe6c4f8b2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究未直接测量ICI疗效（如肿瘤缩小），因此不能直接推断微生物组对疗效的影响，仅能推断对毒性的影响。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::351ab644a30b7b8ea00dbb02\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"supplement_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"auxiliary_material\": \"The study employed a robust methodological framework useful for review methodology discussions, including longitudinal sampling (baseline, during treatment, at irAE onset, post-immunosuppression), both 16S rRNA and metagenomic shotgun sequencing, and multiple differential abundance tools (ANCOM-BC, LinDA, MaAsLin2, ALDEx2) to ensure consistency. The authors discuss limitations regarding sample size for specific taxa and the need for correction for multiple testing, which resulted in some baseline associations (e.g., pathobionts) losing significance after correction.\",\n          \"evidence\": [],\n          \"gap_id\": \"Ch6_gap_5\",\n          \"judgment_path\": \"F:\\\\OptoMind-Review-2\\\\outputs\\\\body_full_staged_acceptance_20261004_40cny\\\\planning\\\\chapters\\\\external\\\\N4452dfb25f491e9335fe-5a6b848383c152a3\\\\round_3\\\\supplements\\\\Ch6_gap_5\\\\attempt-hpbnytrx\\\\source_units\\\\SU01_search_candidate_4736138316\\\\FULFILLMENT_JUDGMENT.json\",\n          \"limitations\": [],\n          \"material_ready\": true,\n          \"material_usefulness\": \"supporting\",\n          \"outline_action_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"remaining_gap\": \"The gap question asks for large-scale microbiome association studies specifically targeting non-colitis irAEs (e.g., myocarditis, neurotoxicity) to verify evidence insufficiency. This study does not fulfill that requirement because it aggregates all severe irAEs into one group; the specific counts for non-colitis irAEs like myocarditis (n=2) and meningitis (n=2) are too small for independent large-scale association analysis. Thus, the existence of a dedicated large-scale study for non-colitis irAE microbiome signatures remains unconfirmed by this material.\",\n          \"remaining_gap_recovered_by_policy\": false,\n          \"status\": \"unmet\",\n          \"useful_material\": \"This prospective cohort study (Verheijden et al., 2025) analyzed 497 stool samples from 195 cancer patients treated with immune checkpoint inhibitors (ICI) to assess gut microbiome associations with severe immune-related adverse events (irAEs). The study included various irAE types listed in Table 1, such as myocarditis (n=2 total), meningitis (n=2 total), pneumonitis (n=4 total), and colitis (n=6 total), but aggregated them into a single 'severe irAE' endpoint for analysis due to low incidence of individual types. Key findings indicated that a higher baseline relative abundance of a prespecified pathobiont group and a stronger decrease in Ruminococcaceae during treatment were associated with developing severe irAEs. At irAE onset, Ruminococcaceae and specific species (R. bromii, R. callidus) were significantly lower, while Haemophilus parainfluenzae was higher compared to other time points. The authors explicitly note in Section 3.6 that only 17 patients provided samples at severe irAE onset, with diverse irAE types (8 colitis, 3 pancreatitis/diabetes, 2 meningitis, 4 others), limiting subtype-specific analysis.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::60b3d7f50c0db0e4655bf040\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0049\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-b5c2e925a4132b88eff6\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-7f937d5566b4c12030ce\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-a96686bee2f7be7a8dd8\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-724817b1ad2fa81c8182\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-ba354d40740f64366cbf\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"missing\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-403bce67afb0fdb07c1f\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::31096503c68e72c641fcbe7e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b16d054e681e54f8a54f2fd2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c4a19a0d9b7f5acaad003b10\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6b3c39236af481f48796c5a5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"As a narrative review, the authors synthesized existing literature on ICI-induced irAEs. The structure follows a logical progression: first, elucidating core immunopathological mechanisms (T-cell, B-cell, cytokine, monocyte axes); second, analyzing multidimensional risk factors (host, environment, treatment, tumor, genetics); third, detailing clinical features, grading, and management strategies for irAEs across major organ systems; and fourth, proposing future research directions focusing on shared mechanisms, predictive models, and optimized intervention strategies. The approach relies on summarizing clinical studies, experimental data, and meta-analyses cited in the references.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b674d56e73dd08f9bbfecb45\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Provides a comprehensive, up-to-date synthesis of the multifaceted mechanisms (cellular and molecular) underlying irAEs, integrating T-cell, B-cell, cytokine, and monocyte pathways.\",\n          \"limits\": \"As a review, it does not present new primary experimental data or validate predictive biomarkers clinically; it summarizes existing evidence which may be heterogeneous.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e03a2182581575edeadacd6c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Offers a detailed, organ-system-based classification of irAEs with specific incidence rates, grading criteria, and tiered management strategies, serving as a practical clinical reference.\",\n          \"limits\": \"Management recommendations are largely based on expert consensus and existing guidelines rather than novel randomized controlled trials presented in this paper.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4394b63dfe98f3127580588e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"Identifies and categorizes diverse risk factors, highlighting the role of gut microbiota and genetic polymorphisms, pointing towards precision medicine approaches.\",\n          \"limits\": \"Many identified risk factors (e.g., specific microbial strains, genetic variants) are noted as having 'promising' but 'not yet universally validated' predictive value; the paper acknowledges the lack of reliable clinical biomarkers.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fe1b12ddfb220879142c6003\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"ICI therapy (anti-CTLA-4, anti-PD-1/PD-L1)\",\n          \"finding\": \"Core mechanisms involve Treg exhaustion, Teff overactivation/cross-reactivity, B-cell autoantibody production, cytokine network imbalance, and monocyte/macrophage inflammatory cascades.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ead3e8fc0c45a6993b000063\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Risk factors analysis\",\n          \"finding\": \"Risk is influenced by host factors (age, sex, BMI, comorbidities), gut microbiota dysbiosis (e.g., Akkermansia muciniphila abundance), treatment regimen (combination therapy increases severity, dose-dependency), tumor type/histology (high TMB/high burden), and genetic factors (HLA polymorphisms like HLA-DR4).\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6798e317fab01f72ee02f0e6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Organ-specific irAEs\",\n          \"finding\": \"Different organs have distinct incidence and severity profiles; e.g., anti-CTLA-4 is linked to colitis/hypophysitis, while anti-PD-1/PD-L1 is linked to pneumonitis/thyroid dysfunction. Rare but fatal events include myocarditis and myasthenia gravis.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::913dc3cf94d1412f8a58d6ea\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"Correlation with efficacy\",\n          \"finding\": \"There is a partial statistical correlation between certain irAEs (e.g., vitiligo) and anti-tumor efficacy, suggesting shared antigenic targets, but excessive immunosuppression may diminish efficacy.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8a675abe54cac9b7e7d6cc86\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"review\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3080cc085a00ab0269bfdf5e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The review addresses the critical challenge that while ICIs significantly improve cancer survival, they cause severe, multi-organ irAEs due to disrupted immune tolerance. Key problems include the lack of reliable predictive biomarkers, incomplete understanding of molecular pathophysiology (especially for rare/fatal irAEs), complex toxicity profiles from combination therapies, and the controversial correlation between irAEs and anti-tumor efficacy. The goal is to provide a systematic framework for clinicians to understand, predict, and manage these toxicities.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::862ed7699d67d89644832217\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The review focuses on immune checkpoint inhibitors (ICIs) used in cancer therapy, specifically examining the mechanisms, risk factors, and clinical management of immune-related adverse events (irAEs). It covers various organ systems (skin, gastrointestinal, endocrine, cardiovascular, etc.) and discusses future research directions. The scope includes solid tumors generally, with specific mentions of melanoma, lung cancer, renal cell carcinoma, and hepatocellular carcinoma.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dc846e4ef365893a676fab0b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"This is a comprehensive review article published in 2025 that systematically summarizes the pathophysiology, risk stratification, and clinical management of irAEs associated with ICIs. It details how ICIs disrupt immune homeostasis through T-cell dysfunction, B-cell autoantibody production, cytokine dysregulation, and monocyte-mediated inflammation. The paper categorizes irAEs by organ system, providing incidence rates, grading criteria, and treatment guidelines. It also identifies multiple risk factors including host characteristics, gut microbiota, genetic polymorphisms, and treatment regimens. Finally, it outlines future strategies for prediction, prevention, and targeted intervention to balance anti-tumor efficacy with safety.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::10c4da75004fc002b1e4e2e2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"The association is observational/correlational in the cited studies. The paper emphasizes the *dual effect*: these same microbes may also increase irAE risk. It does not provide mechanistic depth on *how* exactly the microbiome modulates efficacy beyond general immune activation.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Mentions that high abundance of Akkermansia muciniphila (>4.8%) is associated with prolonged overall survival in NSCLC patients receiving ICIs, attributing this to enhanced CD8+ T lymphocyte activation and IFN-γ secretion. Also notes that other microbes can enhance antitumor immunity.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::309fa2b34a73f9b249924c60\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"The mechanistic details provided are largely inferred from general immunology or cited animal/experimental studies. The paper explicitly states that the molecular interaction networks require further investigation. It does not detail specific microbial metabolites or precise signaling pathways linking microbiota directly to tumor antigen presentation or T-cell priming for efficacy.\",\n          \"contribution\": \"Describes mechanisms where gut microbiota influence T-cell subsets (e.g., Th17 differentiation and function). Dysbiosis may disrupt Th17 homeostasis, leading to hyperfunction and pro-inflammatory cytokine release. It also mentions that specific probiotics/prebiotics can alleviate irAE symptoms, implying a regulatory role.\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f8ea0c7f877777d642503dc8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Discussion of Akkermansia muciniphila having a 'dual effect' (enhancing survival but increasing irAE risk); mention of gut microbiota regulating Th17 cells.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9cd0d7630fcef01909adb663\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"Statement that despite many potential biomarkers (including microbiota-related ones), there is currently no universally acknowledged reliable biomarker for predicting irAE risk.\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::d68a0a45b28262f047176315\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The paper's primary focus is on *adverse events* (irAEs), not efficacy. Any claims about efficacy modulation are secondary mentions or part of the discussion on shared mechanisms/toxicity risks.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::45538ddfc2fb94b27b1abfa3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"The link between gut microbiota and efficacy is described as correlational (e.g., abundance levels associated with survival) rather than definitively causal or mechanistically fully elucidated in this text.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7fb4e1dd9b8b2e79cb3e9d81\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Specific microbial species mentioned (e.g., Akkermansia) are linked to outcomes in specific contexts (NSCLC), and results may not be generalizable to all solid tumors or all ICI types without further verification.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::56536e998c235c8881061947\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"Mechanisms involving gut microbiota are often summarized broadly (e.g., 'regulating T-cell subsets') without detailed molecular pathways, requiring caution when inferring specific causal chains.\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::53339ce4b7ad243f4de96c8b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0260\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-b5c2e925a4132b88eff6\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-7f937d5566b4c12030ce\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-a96686bee2f7be7a8dd8\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-724817b1ad2fa81c8182\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-ba354d40740f64366cbf\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-403bce67afb0fdb07c1f\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::dad3b7f35d836145e9d03851\",\n          \"snapshot::a28036d77e210b3d249c89e2\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e6be6ecb5a21f27c0138909a\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"abstract\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::959196775c9d1a3315640917\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::971b4d6832cb71174bf1acc8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"前瞻性观察性队列研究。对象为俄亥俄州立大学皮肤癌诊所收治的>18岁ICI治疗黑色素瘤患者（排除基线使用皮质类固醇者）。数据收集包括：1. 临床终点：每12周通过RECIST v1.1评估客观缓解率（ORR），记录12个月无进展生存期（PFS）；通过CTCAE v5.0评估irAEs。2. 生物样本：在基线、irAE发生后2天内（医生图表审查确认）、治疗12周时收集粪便样本。3. 实验室分析：Illumina NovaSeq 6000进行宏基因组全基因组鸟枪法测序，使用HUMAnN3进行分类。4. 统计分析：使用R包glmm对微生物相对丰度与irAEs的影响进行逻辑回归建模，并校正错误发现率（FDR）。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c4a2c53e2690a84e1e092162\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了纵向微生物组数据，识别出能区分不同临床表型（响应/非响应、有/无irAE）的具体细菌和噬菌体标志物。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代因果机制验证结果；仅观察到关联性，作者明确指出未来分析需分配因果角色。样本量较小（n=32可评估响应），且为单中心观察性研究，外推性受限。未涵盖真菌的作用细节（仅提及无关联）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::dfac6126f2e15d75dc95ae48\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"总体响应 vs 非响应（基于ORR）\",\n          \"finding\": \"响应者中富集Bacteroides dorei (FDR p=9.5E-07) 和 Blautia species CAG:257 (padj=0.001)；非响应者中富集 Prevotella Stercorea (padj=1.1E-07) 和一种靶向沙门氏菌的噬菌体 (padj=8.3E-09)。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7211c1c99a88d8c48939669c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"有irAE的响应者 vs 无irAE的响应者\",\n          \"finding\": \"有irAE的响应者富集 Bacteroides plebeius (padj=4.2E-13) 和 Bacteroides coprophilus (padj=0.0002)；无irAE的响应者富集 Eubacterium siraeum (padj=7.2E-05)。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b9a6a65235d29e1700adcfc1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"整体微生物组特征与毒性/响应的关联\",\n          \"finding\": \"未发现真菌与响应或毒性显著相关。Bacteroides属的高丰度与irAEs显著相关，也与ICI响应一致。富含Bacteroides且缺乏Prevotella的微生物组特征与ICI响应相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a5c666c5f616d2a23da568a3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a6b817380c5901818a136666\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"既往研究表明irAE的发生与治疗响应相关，但二者往往难以解耦。本研究试图解决的核心问题是：肠道微生物组是否能在不同时间点（基线、irAE发生时、12周）独立预测ICI治疗的响应或毒性？特别是能否找到能区分“有效但有副作用”与“有效且无副作用”患者的微生物特征，从而为临床管理提供潜在的生物标志物。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::74f9995c67b241b47c1c563d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"转移性黑色素瘤患者，接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗；研究聚焦于肠道微生物组在基线、irAE发生期间及12周时的动态变化与临床结局（响应/毒性）的关联。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::979c21845a0e3c516f0051d0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在确定转移性黑色素瘤患者在ICI治疗过程中，肠道微生物组的组成能否预测治疗响应或免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）。研究纳入了88名患者，其中48名为转移性疾病患者，32名可评估响应。通过纵向采集粪便样本并进行宏基因组鸟枪法测序，分析特定微生物丰度与ORR、PFS及irAEs之间的关联。研究发现某些细菌和噬菌体与响应或非响应显著相关，且存在能够区分“有irAE的响应者”与“无irAE的响应者”的特异性微生物标志物。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::162f1683c7d1f23ac12fadad\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅为观察性关联，不能证明因果关系。样本局限于黑色素瘤，可能不适用于所有实体瘤。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了具体的微生物物种水平证据，表明特定菌群（如Bacteroides, Blautia）与ICI响应正相关，而Prevotella与无响应相关。同时指出了Bacteroides丰度与irAEs的正相关性。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0ac17c8e6efb31e00f2e8705\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"摘要未提供具体的分子机制解释（如抗原模拟、代谢产物等），仅停留在相关性层面。需要结合其他文献补充机制细节。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了通过微生物组特征区分‘有效且有副作用’与‘有效且无副作用’的可能性（例如Eubacterium siraeum与无irAE响应相关）。这暗示了微生物组可能在调节疗效与毒性平衡中起中介作用。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7db3f5a0d510f33fe389eaef\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"研究设计采用了纵向和事件驱动的样本采集策略（基线、irAE发生时、12周），并使用宏基因组测序而非16S rRNA。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1b84ff28178816f733acb2da\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"发现噬菌体（phage）与无响应相关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1e518a51f26908558e338268\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究结果为观察性关联，严禁将其解读为因果证据或已验证的治疗建议。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ea8e4e551b0e56fc1dff43c2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"结论主要基于黑色素瘤数据，应用于其他实体瘤时需保持谨慎，除非有其他证据支持跨癌种一致性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::2824b3f22e827bf8f32fedf2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"‘解耦’一词在标题中是目标描述，实际结果仅显示统计关联，尚未证实可通过干预微生物组来主动解耦。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1cceaea08601a36b1c2fd402\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"样本量有限，p值虽显著但需注意多重比较校正后的效力，避免过度解读单个物种的效应大小。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::14b2d784889f9995695c35d3\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0239\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"no complete research body was indexed\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"only abstract or non-title snippets were available\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"abstract_only\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::752df8ff448a789477de82ce\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6a2f8b93f81009c30ad72353\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"abstract\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::57719c927849bb7bcef3ee18\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1d645134099167f58e18c62c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"采用回顾性队列设计。首先从机构粪便生物库中识别90名接受ICI治疗的晚期黑色素瘤患者，要求有≥1个治疗前或治疗中的粪便样本进行16S rRNA扩增子测序。其次，根据临床反应将患者分为三个亚组：响应者（R，无进展）、原发耐药（pR，起始后<6个月进展）和获得性耐药（aR，起始后≥6个月进展）。统计分析包括：使用Kaplan-Meier和Cox比例风险模型分析临床协变量与生存的关系；使用Alpha和Beta多样性指标比较微生物特征；在各分类水平上使用Wilcoxon秩和检验进行成对比较。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b2277c2461af6ea75b8774cd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了基线肠道微生物组特征与ICI疗效亚型及irAEs关联的具体实证数据，特别是指出了SCFA产生菌（如F. prausnitzii）在响应者中高丰度的现象。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代具体的统计校正细节（除p adj外）、微生物鉴定的具体分辨率（种/属水平）、以及样本量较小（n=90）带来的统计效力限制。结论仅为相关性提示，未证实因果机制。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bb3f7102f49193abc788f9d8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"比较不同响应亚组（R, pR, aR）及irAE发生情况\",\n          \"finding\": \"基线α多样性在各亚组间无显著差异；β多样性呈现差异趋势（p=0.084），但未达统计学显著性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f0b8e61a52a394046017b826\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"比较响应者与不同耐药亚组的特定菌属\",\n          \"finding\": \"产丁酸菌Faecalibacterium prausnitzii在响应者（R）中的丰度显著高于原发耐药者（pR）和获得性耐药者（aR）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::85b4e9e2d1247881ba3aa6b7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"比较其他SCFA产生菌\",\n          \"finding\": \"其他短链脂肪酸（SCFA）产生菌，如Coprococcus comes, Dorea longicatena, Blautia glucerasea，在响应者中丰度显著更高，且在未发生irAEs的患者中丰度也更高。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0ea9066988d1b4879225dd90\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"irAEs与生存期的关联\",\n          \"finding\": \"发生irAEs的患者进展无病生存期（PFS）显著长于未发生irAEs的患者（中位PFS 1412天 vs. 106天，p=0.026）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::193f09bdf0baa896c2e581b4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fd353b433a82204e73c91fe6\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管已知肠道微生物组可能作为ICI疗效的生物标志物，但尚不清楚基线微生物组组成能否预测特定的ICI耐药亚型（原发vs.获得性）或irAEs的发生。本研究试图定义与这些临床结果相关的基线微生物组特征。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9bb4eec23552d85fa4d9b99e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究对象为接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的晚期黑色素瘤患者。研究情境基于机构内的粪便生物库，纳入90名具有治疗前或治疗中粪便样本的患者。范围限定于基线肠道微生物组特征与ICI疗效亚型（原发耐药、获得性耐药、响应者）及免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）之间的关联分析。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::73df25717fa171314a35e42e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在探讨基线肠道微生物组组成是否能预测特定类型的ICI耐药性或irAEs的发生。研究团队从生物库中筛选出90名晚期黑色素瘤患者，根据疾病进展时间将其分为三组：响应者（R）、原发耐药者（pR）和获得性耐药者（aR）。通过16S rRNA扩增子测序分析基线微生物特征，并结合临床数据评估其与生存结局及irAEs的相关性。结果显示，虽然各组间α多样性无显著差异，但短链脂肪酸（SCFA）产生菌丰度在响应者中显著更高，且这些菌群也与不出现irAEs相关，提示SCFAs可能在介导ICI疗效和保护免受irAEs方面发挥作用。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e6d5db0be949bca0b0eea954\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅针对晚期黑色素瘤；样本量有限；主要基于相关性而非功能性验证。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了特定微生物类群（SCFA产生菌）与ICI疗效正相关的实证数据。发现响应者中F. prausnitzii及其他SCFA产生菌丰度显著高于耐药者。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cf29a57e65e341bf6850f872\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"机制假说性质强，缺乏直接的代谢物测量或功能实验验证；观察性研究无法确立因果链条。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了SCFAs（特别是丁酸）可能作为介导ICI疗效和防止irAEs的潜在机制分子。发现高丰度SCFA产生菌既与响应相关，也与不发生irAEs相关。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6d059ff00cd7f4bcb25d5a88\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"研究区分了原发耐药和获得性耐药，发现基线α多样性无差异，但β多样性有趋势差异，说明整体群落结构可能不如特定功能菌群重要。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6945839f4545f0881ada1e60\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"数据显示irAEs发生与更长PFS相关，且SCFA产生菌在未发生irAEs者中更高，这似乎与直觉相悖（通常认为irAEs预示更好疗效），提示微生物组可能通过复杂途径同时影响疗效和毒性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::db2c61045e7d2552ab68d06d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究为观察性关联，不能证明SCFA产生菌直接导致更好的疗效或更少的irAEs。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5f8b333342de0d627dda2a0c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"样本来自单一机构，可能存在选择偏倚或人群特异性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4783dce0790965c0e23d02e7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"16S rRNA测序仅提供分类学信息，未提供功能基因或代谢物水平的直接证据，机制解释为作者推测。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a30fb11fb35f764bc48fc75e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"“未发生irAEs”与“高SCFA产生菌”的正相关可能与“发生irAEs”与“好疗效”的正相关存在复杂的交互作用，需谨慎解读。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3954d7d48795dd4abc4a6e8c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0428\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"no complete research body was indexed\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"only abstract or non-title snippets were available\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"abstract_only\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::820c5fef183c1e2973da4cf6\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5a58b310d6a1fcbf644a7861\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::16d1dbf3fbc16c9c8b51b5c7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::23a2e83f16cac9e170ef380d\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"设计为单中心、前瞻性观察性队列研究。纳入标准：≥18岁转移性黑色素瘤患者，计划接受ICI治疗；排除标准：除生理替代外使用皮质类固醇者。样本收集：基线（ICI开始前10天内）、irAE发生时（CTCAE v5.0分级≥1级）、12周时采集粪便和血液样本。临床评估：每12周通过RECIST v1.1评估肿瘤反应和无进展生存期（PFS）。微生物分析：采用Illumina NovaSeq 6000进行宏基因组鸟枪法测序，使用MetaPhlAn4/HUMAnN3进行分类和谱系分析，使用ANCOM-BC2进行差异丰度分析以识别响应者/非响应者及irAE发生/未发生组间的显著差异分类群。统计显著性设定为q-value < 0.05。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cd3b02229ef600929713fd51\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了在单中心转移性黑色素瘤队列中，基线肠道微生物组特征与ICI治疗反应及irAEs发生的具体关联数据；识别出可能与“高疗效低毒性”相关的特定微生物（如Blautia luti）；验证了Lachnospiraceae家族在ICI反应中的普遍关联性。\",\n          \"limits\": \"样本量较小（n=41可评估反应，n=11发生>1级irAEs），限制了发现的普遍性和统计效力；单中心研究，人群多样性有限；观察性设计无法确立因果关系；未控制饮食等生活方式因素；基线采样窗口较宽（10天），可能引入变异；排除基线使用皮质类固醇的患者可能引入选择偏倚。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8c7b4bbbb48579d13f510dc7\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基线微生物组，转移性黑色素瘤患者（n=41可评估），ICI治疗\",\n          \"finding\": \"响应者（R）中Intestinimonas butyriciproducens (q=0.002)和Longicatena caecimuris (q=0.003)富集；非响应者（NR）中Tenericutes (q=0.001)和Lachnospira sp.NSJ 43 (q=0.002)富集。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::617e0a79c10627a1d064c820\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基线微生物组，ICI治疗反应与irAEs关联\",\n          \"finding\": \"Blautia luti及其他Lachnospiraceae成员与“既有反应又无irAE”的状态相关（反应q=0.02，无irAE q=0.02）。在该队列中，治疗反应与irAEs之间未观察到统计学关系（P=0.368）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bf625e1cc90095b79b75f482\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"irAEs发生情况，基线微生物组\",\n          \"finding\": \"未发生irAEs组中Lachnospiraceae（包括Anaerotignum和Enterocloster物种）较多；发生irAEs组中Bifidobacterium较多。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::3c98465b886a8558c857e9fd\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::97ec4ce12791278224a63208\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"主要问题：在转移性黑色素瘤中，基线肠道微生物组能否预测ICI的治疗反应和免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）？动机：仅约半数患者对ICI有反应，且10-40%经历irAEs；理解这些因素的底层机制有助于改善预后并减少毒性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::97564157202dd84268e8d014\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究对象为接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的转移性黑色素瘤患者。研究情境为俄亥俄州立大学综合癌症中心皮肤癌诊所的单中心前瞻性观察队列。范围限定于基线肠道微生物组对ICI治疗反应（RECIST v1.1标准）及免疫相关不良事件（irAEs，CTCAE v5.0标准）的预测关联。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a3f36979553a1fc466731d77\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"本研究旨在确定治疗前的肠道微生物组是否能预测转移性黑色素瘤患者对ICI的反应或毒性。研究纳入88名计划接受ICI治疗的患者，其中41名具有完整数据和转移性疾病信息。通过宏基因组鸟枪法测序分析基线粪便样本，比较响应者（R）与非响应者（NR），以及发生irAEs与未发生irAEs患者之间的微生物组成差异。研究发现，特定微生物丰度与治疗反应显著相关，且部分微生物同时与良好反应和低毒性风险相关，提示微生物组可能作为生物标志物或治疗靶点，但研究未确立因果关系。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::60cbb55146f3b016f0b780fe\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅限转移性黑色素瘤患者；单中心数据；观察性关联，非因果证明；样本量小，特别是irAE亚组；未控制混杂因素如饮食。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了基线肠道微生物组成分与ICI治疗反应（RECIST标准）及irAEs发生（CTCAE标准）的具体关联列表。例如，Intestinimonas butyriciproducens和Longicatena caecimuris与响应正相关，而Tenericutes与非响应正相关。Blautia luti与“响应且无irAE”状态相关。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::78ca6ea9f3f192072fcca79e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"机制多为基于文献的综合推测和本研究的关联提示，本研究本身未直接验证这些机制；具体机制（如肉碱依赖）引用自其他模型系统研究；作者承认机制尚未完全阐明。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"讨论了Lachnospiraceae可能的作用机制，包括代谢（膳食纤维、异生物质、胆汁酸）、免疫调节（短链脂肪酸产生）和生态位排斥。提及Blautia spp.可能与肉碱依赖机制有关。指出抗原模拟、TLR激活和小分子分泌是潜在的通用机制。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::6a0027622e6f44d6fc753ec0\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"仅约半数患者对ICI有反应，10-40%经历irAEs；irAEs可能影响生活质量甚至导致死亡；目前缺乏指导irAEs预防或管理的科学证据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9e2019c10f89947651eeef8e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"研究发现某些微生物（如Blautia luti）与“响应且无irAE”相关，表明反应和毒性可能在微生物组层面被解耦，存在优化疗效同时降低毒性的可能性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::932980f8923d6981889f3af2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"使用宏基因组鸟枪法测序结合ANCOM-BC2进行差异丰度分析；前瞻性纵向样本收集设计。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::16173882fcc6dbf32009b761\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究为观察性关联，不能推断因果关系。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::a01bcc8eb444669407a53eaa\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"结果仅限于转移性黑色素瘤，外推至其他固体肿瘤类型需谨慎。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::315a2fecd5209e56a3f3256e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"样本量较小，特别是irAEs亚组，可能导致假阴性或效应量估计不准确。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::cbf95136c2a6588e03cbc6a5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"未控制饮食等关键混杂因素，可能影响微生物组结果的解读。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::758c878055143ed5909fb5bf\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"基线采样时间窗较宽，可能掩盖短期动态变化。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::9a8a340ab740f858307a0f44\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"排除基线使用皮质类固醇的患者，可能限制结果在更广泛临床人群中的适用性。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1fee5b66ec78aababda36306\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0314\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-b5c2e925a4132b88eff6\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-7f937d5566b4c12030ce\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-a96686bee2f7be7a8dd8\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-724817b1ad2fa81c8182\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"asset_id\": \"asset-ba354d40740f64366cbf\",\n              \"kind\": \"asset\",\n              \"reason\": \"caption_or_locator_without_readable_image\",\n              \"status\": \"caption_only\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"fulltext\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::ed51308a119087567f15d8b4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b67c869eee5a32d72d756c1f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"abstract\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::905a16b1317dae09553557fb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4fc1b23aa9738aec8d869909\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"纵向队列研究设计。收集III期黑色素瘤患者在联合ICI治疗前（基线）和治疗后第6周的配对粪便样本（n=126）和外周血PBMC样本（n=71）。使用16S rRNA基因测序分析肠道微生物组成，使用质谱流式细胞术全面 profiling 循环免疫细胞亚群。比较基线与第6周的微生物和免疫指标变化，并分析其与临床应答状态及irAEs严重程度的关联。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ddc7133862b1e98dee7bbcc4\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了纵向证据，表明肠道微生物组（特别是拟杆菌属和瘤胃球菌科）与ICI治疗期间的免疫细胞动态（特别是Tregs）及临床结局（应答和irAEs）存在关联。\",\n          \"limits\": \"所给摘要未交代具体的统计校正方法（如多重检验校正）、微生物功能推断细节、以及是否控制了其他混杂因素（如抗生素使用、饮食等）。此外，作为会议摘要，缺乏完整的实验细节和长期随访数据。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5ced063ef4d895bb2527ef3c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"ICI治疗前后对比\",\n          \"finding\": \"治疗导致循环中CD8+效应记忆T细胞（Tem）频率增加（P=0.0096）和调节性T细胞（Tregs）频率减少（P=0.0029）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::df0c22db80cc042e49db6078\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"根据临床应答分类\",\n          \"finding\": \"Tregs的减少主要在应答者中观察到（P=0.0016），而在非应答者中无显著变化（P=0.9515）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::155a4a53fa9c96215b2c32fe\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"根据irAEs严重程度分类\",\n          \"finding\": \"发生严重irAEs的患者在第6周时Tregs显著缺乏（P=0.0293），相比无或轻度毒性患者。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::4dd917c890edeb09e25c7941\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基线微生物与免疫变化的关联\",\n          \"finding\": \"在循环Tregs减少的患者中，Tregs减少的程度与基线拟杆菌属（Bacteroides）相对丰度呈正相关（P<0.0001）。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::43564e4cabb74c63d54ecf12\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"基线微生物与临床结局的关联\",\n          \"finding\": \"较高的基线拟杆菌属丰度与更严重的irAEs发展（P=0.0472）及第6周前更高的类固醇使用率（P=0.0345）相关。相反，较高的瘤胃球菌科（Ruminococcaceae）丰度具有保护作用，且瘤胃球菌科主导的微生物组患者中应答者比例更高。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::13b30b98ec45be93bfcf01d5\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"paper_kind\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"empirical\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::b52da9c89aaeaaa5b0749b6e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"problem_or_question\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"尽管已知肠道微生物组影响ICI疗效，但具体机制不明。本研究试图解决：肠道微生物如何与免疫系统相互作用以影响ICI的成功或irAEs的发生？特别是特定细菌类群（如拟杆菌属和瘤胃球菌科）与免疫细胞亚群变化及临床结局之间的关联。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::15613d5b09de0b9d50378597\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"research_scope\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"III期黑色素瘤患者，接受新辅助联合抗PD-1/抗CTLA-4免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗；涉及澳大利亚和荷兰队列（n=126），其中71名患者有匹配的PBMC数据。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::35e128a47c0a17f95654887c\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"work_summary\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究旨在阐明肠道微生物组与免疫系统在ICI治疗中的纵向动态关系及其对疗效和免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的影响。通过对126名患者的基线和第6周粪便样本进行16S rRNA基因测序，并对71名患者的外周血单个核细胞（PBMCs）进行质谱流式细胞术分析，研究发现ICI治疗导致循环中CD8+效应记忆T细胞增加和调节性T细胞（Tregs）减少。Tregs的减少主要见于应答者，但在发生严重irAEs的患者中也观察到显著缺乏。基线拟杆菌属（Bacteroides）丰度与Tregs减少程度及严重irAEs风险正相关，而瘤胃球菌科（Ruminococcaceae）高丰度则具有保护作用并关联更好的应答。结论指出肠道微生物组可能通过影响免疫平衡的“临界点”来塑造ICI的治疗结果。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::46fff116fb877592fe07c91f\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"仅针对III期黑色素瘤患者，且为新辅助联合ICI治疗情境；不能直接外推至其他肿瘤类型或单药ICI治疗。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了特定细菌类群（拟杆菌属、瘤胃球菌科）与ICI疗效（客观缓解）及毒性（irAEs严重程度）的具体关联方向和数据支持。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F1\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5ba5a4a521ab5b76c9cdd393\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"facet_contributions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"boundaries\": \"这是基于观察性关联提出的假设性机制（'suggests that...'），并非经过功能验证的因果机制；需结合其他研究确认其普遍性。\",\n          \"contribution\": \"提出了一个潜在的机制线索：肠道微生物组可能通过影响基线免疫稳态（特别是Tregs的水平）来设定免疫反应的‘阈值’或‘临界点’，从而影响抗肿瘤免疫和irAEs的发生。\",\n          \"facet_id\": \"F2\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::bed1c5a92a1c909e5a7e55ec\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"摘要中提到‘how gut microbes interact with the immune system... remains unclear’，反映了该领域的知识空白和研究动机。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::5fb91d23ecba19c99dc65b1b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"broader_review_uses\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"material\": \"拟杆菌属既与Treg减少（通常关联疗效）相关，又与严重irAEs相关；而瘤胃球菌科则显示保护性。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::561b8cc96f7980e0b68fb9a2\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"该研究为会议摘要，详细的方法学细节（如测序深度、生物信息学流程、流式抗体面板、统计分析模型）未在摘要中提供，需谨慎引用具体数值和方法论细节。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::e79b3405bb023182accfa755\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究对象仅限于III期黑色素瘤患者，且接受的是新辅助联合ICI治疗，结果可能不适用于晚期转移性黑色素瘤或其他实体瘤的单药ICI治疗。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::fee2de282937a619aa2bdca1\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"关联不等于因果：观察到的微生物与免疫细胞及临床结局的关联可能是由其他未测量的混杂因素驱动的，或反映的是反向因果关系。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::7929958b24e5e4211328f19b\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"review_planning_B\",\n          \"scope_interpretation_cautions\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"‘拟杆菌属’是一个属水平的分类单元，其内部物种可能存在功能差异，摘要未提供更精细的分类或功能信息。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::8e1908b8bbd498777e918ecb\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0098\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"card_material\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"known_gaps\": [\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"identity\",\n              \"reason\": \"source identity was not independently verified\",\n              \"status\": \"input_attributed\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"no complete research body was indexed\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"kind\": \"coverage\",\n              \"reason\": \"only abstract or non-title snippets were available\",\n              \"status\": \"partial\"\n            }\n          ],\n          \"material_scope\": \"abstract_only\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::abeae3f5437f046402745e3d\",\n          \"snapshot::6bd724179a28fdc49a979613\",\n          \"snapshot::da0f21f85aefb292e922131e\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::113e9e24698e48b617801ee8\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_depth\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"fulltext\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::13d62ece3687ca3ff02b6c26\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"material_status\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"resolved\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ccd742ea527af43296074069\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"approach\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": \"研究设计为前瞻性、多中心、单臂II期临床试验。入组标准包括：NSCLC患者需PD-L1 TPS ≥50%且无一线可操作基因改变；黑色素瘤患者不限BRAF状态。所有患者在开始ICI治疗前一周内接受来自健康供体的单次FMT（口服胶囊）。主要终点是NSCLC队列的ORR。次要终点包括黑色素瘤ORR、1年无进展生存期（PFS）、总生存期（OS）、疾病控制率（DCR）及安全性。微生物组分析采用鸟枪法宏基因组测序，结合定量PCR和高通量培养组学验证细菌变化。此外，通过血浆代谢组学和流式细胞术分析免疫代谢景观，并在抗生素处理的荷瘤小鼠模型中通过回输“丢失”的细菌混合物来验证因果机制。\",\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::1876e77f5afb8193a6a5257e\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"contribution_and_limits\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"contribution\": \"提供了FMT联合ICI在NSCLC和黑色素瘤一线治疗中的临床活性证据，证实FMT可提高ORR。识别出“基线有害菌清除”作为潜在的药效学生物标志物，并揭示了其与色氨酸代谢抑制及CD8+ T细胞扩增的关联。\",\n          \"limits\": \"研究为单臂设计，缺乏安慰剂对照，难以完全排除自然病程或其他混杂因素。样本量较小（每队列20人），限制了亚组分析和统计效力。黑色素瘤队列中观察到的严重毒性信号（如心肌炎）需要更大规模的随机试验进一步确认。供体选择对毒性的影响提示个体化差异，但具体筛选标准尚未确立。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::999c7dbb4eb04f853f51ce68\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"NSCLC患者接受FMT+抗PD-1\",\n          \"finding\": \"ORR达到80%（16/20），满足主要终点；1年OS为100%；未观察到3级及以上与治疗相关的不良事件。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::ef45091c05d3c80087467567\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"黑色素瘤患者接受FMT+抗PD-1+抗CTLA-4\",\n          \"finding\": \"ORR为75%（15/20）；观察到较文献报道更早发生的严重免疫相关不良反应（irAEs），包括心肌炎；部分严重AEs与富含Prevotella的供体有关。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::0c4539dfe7511b5ee26afddc\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"微生物组分析与临床响应关联\",\n          \"finding\": \"响应者（R）与非响应者（NR）相比，在FMT后表现出显著更高的基线细菌物种丢失幅度。这种丢失主要由有害菌（如Enterocloster, Clostridium, Streptococcus）构成，而非供体菌株的定植。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::f77d7a57b1c5af196e7ec273\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n          \"study_summary_A\",\n          \"key_findings\"\n        ],\n        \"value\": {\n          \"conditions\": \"机制验证（动物实验）\",\n          \"finding\": \"在抗生素处理的小鼠中，将FMT响应者基线样本中丢失的有害细菌混合物重新引入，抵消了FMT联合ICI的抗肿瘤效应，证实消除有害菌是治疗获益的必要条件。\"\n        },\n        \"role\": \"evidence\",\n        \"snapshot_ids\": [\n          \"snapshot::3f08daede868f51719f44f75\",\n          \"snapshot::cc9c61313270bf8ed21449cd\",\n          \"snapshot::858e2e285637cdae2d18e8b5\",\n          \"snapshot::e0ab03ae8f4e8669b7c7052e\",\n          \"snapshot::ceff59cf10840ae2fa4f87a4\"\n        ]\n      },\n      {\n        \"atom_id\": \"atom::c5bc8bb178fbe4aff2844625\",\n        \"source_handle\": \"P0583\",\n        \"field_path\": [\n      